#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな物、壊してやりたいけど…
#. 壊したら大変な事になるんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd love to just smash the stupid thing, but who knows\n"
"what would happen to me if I did...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>カメラを壊したらダメだけど、
#. 見えないようにレンズを塞ぐのはどうなんだろう？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe we're not allowed to break them, but what about\n"
"blocking them so they can't see anything?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…試す勇気はないけど。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Nope, still not brave enough to try it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>苗木は時計を見上げた。
#. そしてため息をついた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I looked up at the clock, and I sighed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この２階の教室にも、
#. やっぱり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess I shouldn't be surprised, but on the 2nd floor\n"
"too...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄板のような物が、
#. 打ち付けられているのか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The windows here have those same metal plates covering\n"
"them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所…
#. だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In any normal classroom, this is where a window would\n"
"be. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり…ここも鉄板か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...here there's just that metal plate.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
